I would strengthen this section in two ways: **add a few researchers whose work directly matches harmonic analysis**, and **explain how the workshop will engage local researchers and students**, rather than relying mainly on geographical proximity.

For the main paragraph, my strongest additions would be **Jun Cao in Hangzhou** and **Hongquan Li in Shanghai**. There are several other useful candidates, depending on the workshop’s particular emphasis.

